1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
MENDAKI is introducing

2
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:01,740
the Ready for School

3
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,140
e-voucher initiative

4
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,140
which we hope to help kids

5
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:04,860
from Primary One

6
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,800
all the way up to university.

7
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,960
So, as we begin the school year

8
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,240
as you know, for many parents

9
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,220
it's also a time where

10
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:10,560
there are a lot of

11
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,440
expenses for school

12
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,220
and we want our kids

13
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,780
to have the best start in life.

14
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,260
You have things like

15
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,040
schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms

16
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:16,960
and other expenses

17
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,480
that parents have to fork out.

18
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,420
And during these times

19
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,160
especially when you have

20
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:21,640
cost of living concerns

21
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,460
challenging times

22
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,280
we want to help parents

23
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:23,980
from low-income families

24
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,860
to support their kids.

25
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,440
This year, MENDAKI

26
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,040
is giving out $250 e-vouchers

27
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,240
that parents can use

28
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,060
for their children

29
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,520
whether it's schoolbooks

30
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:31,600
whether it is stationery

31
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,040
or even shoes.

32
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:34,080
We are pegging it at about

33
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,420
$1,000 per capita income

34
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:36,100
and below.

35
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,280
So we expect more than

36
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,740
22,000 students

37
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:40,300
who could benefit from this.

38
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,120
And this is in addition to

39
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,220
about 13,000 others

40
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,160
that typically benefit

41
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,060
from our TTFS

42
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:44,960
and other MENDAKI schemes

43
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:45,520
as well.

44
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,480
So it's an application basis

45
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:47,060
and we start to take

46
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,420
applications from 1st December.

47
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,340
So we hope that this

48
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,580
will do its part

49
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,940
to help parents and children

50
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,260
have a good start for the year

51
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:53,940
and not to worry

52
00:00:53,940 --> 00:00:55,160
about some of these expenses

53
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,020
that would have otherwise

54
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,700
held them back.
